# The WoW 3.3.5a / Ascension client parses .toc (and reads .lua/.xml) expecting
# Windows CRLF line endings. If the .toc is committed/checked out with LF-only
# endings, the client fails to parse it and the addon is not detected at all.
# Mark the addon's text files as binary so git preserves the exact CRLF bytes
# on commit, checkout, and ZIP/archive downloads (no EOL normalization).
PicoPawn/*.toc  -text
PicoPawn/*.lua  -text
PicoPawn/*.xml  -text
PicoPawn/VgerCore/*.lua  -text
